ount":1},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"SI3q166YxgbxzQxMfpiWjQ","review_id":"rszHX-yquf8cnODy2hBnmA","date":"2017-10-01T22:04:56","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9557955265045166,"text_excerpt":"This is my go to wing spot. Their wings are always so crispy and the sauces are great too. The wings are battered, which is why I love them so much. The wings aren't fatty either which is also why I love them so much. My favorite sauce is the Thai chili glaze-it's one of the best sauces I've ever had. Sweet heat is also really good. It's not too spicy, which I like, but if you are looking for a hotter wing I'd recommend getting a hotter sauce. The only sauce I really didn't like was the honey bbq-it was too thick for my taste and had a weird consistency. They also have the best garlic parmesan fries, although I try not to order them every time I go (so I won't feel as bad about myself aft..."},{"business_id":"SI3q166YxgbxzQxMfpiWjQ","review_id":"WO-Xox6k2bE7i2_RlKxNYw","date":"2019-03-09T18:26:58","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9522422552108765,"text_excerpt":"This is my go-to wing place in New Orleans. They have great sauce flavor options, and the wings themselves are pretty big with a nice crunch. I always get the Thai chili glaze and the steen's BBQ sauce as my options. I haven't explored much of their menu otherwise, because I always want wings. The staff are really cool, very friendly people. The only downside is that it's in a shopping center off of Claiborne, and sometimes there's no parking."},{"business_id":"SI3q166YxgbxzQxMfpiWjQ","review_id":"sN6bfGdDncdxapF2L5bHSQ","date":"2015-09-15T02:13:31","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9495620727539062,"text_excerpt":"This wing place is super great! My boyfriend and I have ordered take out twice, both times our order was ready within 15 minutes. We've only had the wings and the fries, and both are top notch. We've had the bayou hot boy, sweet bayou (I think that was the name), and the garlic parm sauce flavors. The bayou hot boy is my personal favorite. It's spicy, but not painfully so. All of the sauces have tremendous flavor. The wings are crispy yet meaty. The fries are super delish. The only item I've had that I haven't cared for was the ranch. It's a little garlicky for my taste. The bleu cheese, however, is perfection. Give these guys a try the next time you're craving some chicken wing goodness!"}],"visual":[{"business_id":"SI3q166YxgbxzQxMfpiWjQ","photo_id":"2NSmxPWKjUx-fKohHiBBiw","label":"menu","image_url":"/photos/2NSmxPWKjUx-fKohHiBBiw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8986766338348389},{"business_id":"SI3q166YxgbxzQxMfpiWjQ","photo_id":"SoN_8h2LB22sPfmgRVY5jQ","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/SoN_8h2LB22sPfmgRVY5jQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8529555201530457},{"business_id":"SI3q166YxgbxzQxMfpiWjQ","photo_id":"lJ0XXQ5nPrU6vu66VrpUrw","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/lJ0XXQ5nPrU6vu66VrpUrw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8446691632270813},{"business_id":"SI3q166YxgbxzQxMfpiWjQ","photo_id":"azA_gzuQ6l9DM4rJ6R3crA","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/azA_gzuQ6l9DM4rJ6R3crA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8418241143226624},{"business_id":"SI3q166YxgbxzQxMfpiWjQ","photo_id":"RkpmkiEvmtH46sD9O9vSRg","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/R